{"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Change","kind":"identifier"}]}]},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/UsingIvorGMN"],"kind":"mentions"},{"content":[{"anchor":"Two-of-these-fire-far-less-often-than-they-used-to","text":"Two of these fire far less often than they used to","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Before the typed tag model, normalization was where a tag’s name and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"its parameter names were put right, so","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNNormalizer\/Change\/canonicalizedTagName(_:_:)"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNNormalizer\/Change\/renamedParameter(_:_:_:)"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"were reported for ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"every","type":"text"}]},{"text":" tag written with an alias or a deprecated","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"parameter name. They are now reported only for a tag that failed to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"promote to a typed payload.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The canonicalization still happens either way — it just usually","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"happens in the parser, where promotion selects the payload and the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"payload ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"is","type":"text"}]},{"text":" the canonical identity. A ","type":"text"},{"code":"\\bm","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" becomes a ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNBeam"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNBeam"},{"text":" reports the name ","type":"text"},{"code":"beam","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"; there was never an alias","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"stored to rewrite. Only a tag promotion rejected — an unknown","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"parameter, a value no field can carry — keeps its written name far","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"enough downstream for the normalizer’s fallback table to be the thing","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"that fixes it.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"So a caller that counted these changes to detect “this score used","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"short-form tag names” will now see nothing for a score it previously","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reported on. ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"The formatted output is unchanged","type":"text"}]},{"text":": a ","type":"text"},{"code":"\\bm","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" still","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"comes out ","type":"text"},{"code":"\\beam","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". What changed is which stage says so, and therefore","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"whether it is announced at all.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"sections":[],"metadata":{"externalID":"s:7IvorGMN13GMNNormalizerV6ChangeO","modules":[{"name":"IvorGMN"}],"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Change"}],"title":"GMNNormalizer.Change","extendedModule":"IvorGMN","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Change"}],"roleHea